{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1545813-how-dark-should-curseborne-be","id":1545813,"title":"How dark should Curseborne be?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Curseborne"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-11-13T14:00:18-08:00","id":1545813,"title":"How dark should Curseborne be?","content":"It's described as Hopepunk but is also a horror game.<br /> <br /> So how dark should it be in your mind?<br /> <br /> Or should it vary by group and ST?<br /> <br /> Share your thoughts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-13T17:51:50-08:00","id":1545822,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m all for going dark. I don\u2019t see any reason why it can\u2019t be played as dark as WoD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-14T01:59:59-08:00","id":1545840,"title":"","content":"I think Curseborne is going one step further than COD and I think that's a good thing.<br /> <br /> WOD started kind of reveling in being a piece of shit and 5th Edition is the apex of that. Chronicles of Darkness was I felt a more dark and mature horror game with WOD because you were still expected to be a monster but it didn't have the kind of performative evil of the WoD. Which is better demonstrated than explained.<br /> <br /> WoD: &quot;The Union is a bunch of cool edgy badasses who want to wipe out all monsters even if they're kind of fascist. They are in an ideological fight for reality.&quot;<br /> <br /> COD: &quot;The Seers of the Throne want to be rich and get laid by selling out humanity. Which they do every day because they just have to keep the gears of oppression turning.&quot; (edited)<br /> <br /> Like comparing Darth Vader to that guy who lives with his mother in Andor<br /> <br /> Curseborne, by contrast, seems to take the view that the entire fucking world is messed up by the curses and dark supernatural shit leaking in from the Outside and being made worse by certain parties on Earth. You don't need a Seers of the Throne or Exarchs to make things worse because that's just the default of the human race as is.<br /> <br /> So, your characters are capable of pushing back on the WoC's natural state of sucking.<br /> <br /> Like Sam and Dean start by delaing with vampires and demons on an individual level but end up (I refuse to acknowledge past Season 5) trapping the Devil.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-14T02:10:48-08:00","id":1545841,"title":"","content":"I prefer for my games to swing from humour to darkness and back again, because those are the stories I like to tell. But I think Curseborne has plenty of range for different tastes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-14T09:18:11-08:00","id":1545854,"title":"","content":"In many ways I think &quot;how dark&quot; is a misleading question because &quot;dark&quot; isn't really measurable. <br /> <br /> The average episode of What We Do in the Shadows has a higher body count than the average episode of Game of Thrones but that doesn't make it &quot;darker&quot;. An unrelentingly grimdark world like Warhammer 40000 out classic WoD is in some ways more lighthearted than suffering more down to earth where the &quot;dark&quot; elements are more realistic.<br /> <br /> I don't think Curseborne has or needs a &quot;default&quot; tone. It's the kind of thing that can and should be set by individual tables.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28625-nobody-special","name":"Nobody Special","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-14T21:08:34-08:00","id":1545913,"title":"","content":"There are all kinds of different ways to be dark, some of which I like and some not as much. I like having scary disturbing twisted stuff in games - Black Spiral Dancers and their horrific acts, Tzimisce torture and experimentation, inbred abusive Revenant families, Cuckoos that murder your kids and take their form. I like that kind of thing in games, some others may not. <br /> <br /> The kind of darkness that I don\u2019t like is hopelessness or futility. Nihilism even. Nothing that you do matters or can change anything. I want character action to matter, I want to have the possibility of making a difference even if it\u2019s on a personal scale. I want sone degree of virtue to shine through.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-15T08:39:15-08:00","id":1545947,"title":"","content":"As Dark as the Storyteller wishes. There's literally a family of Heart Eaters and Flesh Eaters. <br /> <br /> The setting definitely has a range of dark or light depending on what each player group wants to emphasize.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3769-orphan81","name":"Orphan81","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3769_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-15T08:53:08-08:00","id":1545949,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Orphan81</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1545813-how-dark-should-curseborne-be?p=1545947#post1545947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As Dark as the Storyteller wishes. There's literally a family of Heart Eaters and Flesh Eaters.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which also, I think it's worth pointing out, could equally well be played as Super Dark and Serious, or as, well &quot;all I want is a <i>fricking</i> vampire nightclub with <i>fricking</i> blood sprinklers&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28625-nobody-special","name":"Nobody Special","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}